    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Someone got pulled into a different world and became a ball. Can it reach the escape portal at the top of the world? What will it become when it arrives?</h2><br><strong>GO SOME BALLS</strong> is a 3D platforming challenge about struggling upwards as a ball! A mysterious voice is helping you along. You may face many falls and defeat during the journey. But don't worry, and the voice will always be with you.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/025384d261977dc7da49194aa5a2005c.poster.avif?t=1744499344\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/025384d261977dc7da49194aa5a2005c.webm?t=1744499344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/025384d261977dc7da49194aa5a2005c.mp4?t=1744499344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/7da5df741504d1ef20e06a246e6f5157.poster.avif?t=1744499344\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/7da5df741504d1ef20e06a246e6f5157.webm?t=1744499344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/7da5df741504d1ef20e06a246e6f5157.mp4?t=1744499344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Resist inertia</strong><br>When you have hands and feet, you can control your posture and stop anytime. When you are a ball, you may not stop the inertia of rolling forward, nor can you stop the elasticity of hitting the ground.<br><br><strong>Accept risks</strong><br>The only way forward is up, and your only enemy is yourself! If you are not careful, you may bounce in an unknown place. Getting over it and restarting again.<br><br><strong>Choose your path</strong><br>During your journey of going up, you will need to choose your path. A difficult path may bring you up faster, and an easy path may let you fall less.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/47c28ae2c21a97655321262a8cd12ac8.poster.avif?t=1744499344\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/47c28ae2c21a97655321262a8cd12ac8.webm?t=1744499344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/47c28ae2c21a97655321262a8cd12ac8.mp4?t=1744499344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Realistic physics simulation in Unreal Engine 5.3<br></li><li>Easy and difficult routes and you can choose your way.<br></li><li>Beautiful graphics (if your computer can withstand it).<br></li><li>Lose your progress over and over.<br></li><li>Feel frustration.<br></li><li>0.5 to \u221e hours of inspirational gameplay, depending.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/6c454366c492dc920f2e4b5efc3e56e3.poster.avif?t=1744499344\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/6c454366c492dc920f2e4b5efc3e56e3.webm?t=1744499344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/6c454366c492dc920f2e4b5efc3e56e3.mp4?t=1744499344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The game does not include:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Incredibly difficult control system<br></li><li>Many bugs that may let you fall<br></li><li>The extremely difficult level that you must pass</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/443353d1b506042a816b6c02ccd3a808.poster.avif?t=1744499344\" width=600 height=168 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/443353d1b506042a816b6c02ccd3a808.webm?t=1744499344\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683350/extras/443353d1b506042a816b6c02ccd3a808.mp4?t=1744499344\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Now, Roll and Jump!</strong></h2>",
